: 0.6767676767676768, "x1": 0.14065934065934066, "y1": 0.6868686868686869}], [{"text": "Total marks 15", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.26373626373626374, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "Attempt Questions 1-4", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.0979020979020979, "x1": 0.31648351648351647, "y1": 0.1111111111111111}, {"text": "Answer the questions in the spe", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.12665112665112666, "x1": 0.37142857142857144, "y1": 0.13986013986013987}, {"text": "s provided. These spaces provide guidance for the expected", "x0": 0.3967032967032967, "y0": 0.12665112665112666, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.13986013986013987}, {"text": "length of response.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.14296814296814297, "x1": 0.2725274725274725, "y1": 0.1561771561771562}, {"text": "Your answers will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.17016317016317017, "x1": 0.5351648351648352, "y1": 0.18337218337218336}, {"text": "\u00a9 demonstrate understanding of the relationship between language, text, audience and", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.19036519036519037, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.20357420357420358}, {"text": "purpose", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.2097902097902098, "x1": 0.22967032967032966, "y1": 0.2198912198912199}, {"text": "The Listening Task", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.2432012432012432, "x1": 0.2857142857142857, "y1": 0.2564102564102564}, {"text": "You are about to hear an excerpt from an episode of the podcast The Summer Hack from", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.26884226884226886, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.28205128205128205}, {"text": "triple j, titled \u201cWhat it\u2019s like Working as a Lady Tradie\u2019. In this podcast, host, Dave Marchese", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.28593628593628595, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.29914529914529914}, {"text": "and reporter, Ellie Grounds interview women working as tradies,", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.30225330225330227, "x1": 0.6461538461538462, "y1": 0.31546231546231546}, {"text": "Note: A tradie is an Australian term for a skilled worker, such as an electrician, plumber, or", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.32867132867132864, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.3418803418803419}, {"text": "builder.", "x0": 0.16923076923076924, "y0": 0.34498834498834496, "x1": 0.23076923076923078, "y1": 0.3550893550893551}, {"text": "Before you hear the recording, you will have two minutes to read the questions printed in", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3714063714063714, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.38461538461538464}, {"text": "this paper.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3877233877233877, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.40093240093240096}, {"text": "As you are listening to the recording, follow the questions. You may write notes if you wish", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.411033411033411, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.43123543123543123}, {"text": "in the Candidate\u2019s Notes spaces provided on pages 2-4. Anything you write in the Candidate\u2019s", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.43045843045843046, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.44366744366744365}, {"text": "Notes spaces will NOT be marked. You may make notes or write your answers at any time as", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.44755244755244755, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.46076146076146074}, {"text": "you are listening to the recording.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.46386946386946387, "x1": 0.3923076923076923, "y1": 0.47707847707847706}, {"text": "You will hear the recording and then the questions will be read aloud. You will hear the", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4902874902874903, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.5034965034965035}, {"text": "recording a SECOND time and then you will be given time to complete the answers.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5066045066045066, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.5198135198135199}, {"text": "You now have two minutes to read the questions.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5337995337995338, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.5462315462315462}, {"text": "Question 1 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.578088578088578, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.5905205905205905}, {"text": "How does Dave Marchese encourage the audience to be curious about tradies in the opening", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.60994560994561, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.6223776223776224}, {"text": "of this podcast?", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.6254856254856255, "x1": 0.24615384615384617, "y1": 0.6386946386946387}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.26043956043956046, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.6065934065934065, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}, {"text": "With kind permission of Australian Broadcasting Corporation (ABC)", "x0": 0.47912087912087914, "y0": 0.912975912975913, "x1": 0.8769230769230769, "y1": 0.9222999222999223}], [{"text": "9287310054 |", "x0": 0.7769230769230769, "y0": 0.037296037296037296, "x1": 0.9307692307692308, "y1": 0.059052059052059055}, {"text": "Question 2 (4 marks)", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "Analyse how Ellie and Elijha communicate the dangers of being an electrician.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.7604395604395604, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "Question 3 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.47785547785547783, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.4902874902874903}, {"text": "Explain Mel reasons for creating her social media group, Lady Tradies and Rocking", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5112665112665112, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.5244755244755245}, {"text": "Chicks.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5291375291375291, "x1": 0.17802197802197803, "y1": 0.5384615384615384}, {"text": "Please turn over", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.7777777777777778, "x1": 0.56923076923